e code on load; tampered weights carry backdoors" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#EAF2FB;strokeColor=#C9D1D9;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="130" width="400" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v13" value="&lt;b&gt;00 Supply chain (Ollama / GGUF)&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#EAF2FB;strokeColor=#C9D1D9;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="208" width="230" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v14" value="Integrity of the quantized package and its embedded template" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#EAF2FB;strokeColor=#C9D1D9;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="208" width="360" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15" value="Blob SHA-256 vs content address; GGUF Jinja chat template scanned for code-execution (SSTI) patterns; added system prompt; licence layer" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#EAF2FB;strokeColor=#C9D1D9;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="208" width="470" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v16" value="LLM03, LLM04" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#EAF2FB;strokeColor=#C9D1D9;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="208" width="170" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v17" value="A repackaged model is a different artifact; templates can execute code in some runtimes" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#EAF2FB;strokeColor=#C9D1D9;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" ve